sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Browser
    participant FinancialController
    participant FinancialService
    participant ExpenseCategoryService
    participant Db

    Admin->>Browser: Open expense form in /financial
    Browser->>FinancialController: GET categories for condominium
    FinancialController->>ExpenseCategoryService: List active categories
    ExpenseCategoryService->>Db: SELECT * FROM ExpenseCategories WHERE CondominiumId = ...
    Db-->>ExpenseCategoryService: categories with hashtags
    ExpenseCategoryService-->>FinancialController: category DTOs
    FinancialController-->>Browser: active category list

    Admin->>Browser: Type in category autocomplete
    Browser->>Browser: Filter by name/hashtag locally
    Admin->>Browser: Select category and save expense
    Browser->>FinancialController: POST expense with ExpenseCategoryId
    FinancialController->>FinancialService: Create expense record
    FinancialService->>FinancialService: Validate category belongs to condominium
    FinancialService->>Db: INSERT FinancialRecord
    Db-->>FinancialService: persisted record
    FinancialService-->>FinancialController: result
    FinancialController-->>Browser: 201 Created
